      {
        "name": "places/ChIJ525mEQABBDQRSf8zgvxsusE/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5QlRXbHFlWGRNTjIxWGFEQjVlVVU1WTJOa1dWRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "氣氛很好 望著維港美景用餐\n點了招牌的素漢堡 竟然真的有濃郁的牛味\n推薦推薦 不論肉食愛好者或素食者都很值得一試！",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "氣氛很好 望著維港美景用餐\n點了招牌的素漢堡 竟然真的有濃郁的牛味\n推薦推薦 不論肉食愛好者或素食者都很值得一試！",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "himchi",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107545846368727974688/reviews",
          "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIdbS1sJFXGQ5QdT6v07aoeTxMPg5cO0jxCOw_E2MtaMvgcBA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo"
        },
        "publishTime": "2026-07-15T14:15:11.101364242Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5QlRXbHFlWGRNTjIxWGFEQjVlVVU1WTJOa1dWRRAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5QlRXbHFlWGRNTjIxWGFEQjVlVVU1WTJOa1dWRRAB!2m1!1s0x3404010011666ee7:0xc1ba6cfc8233ff49"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJ525mEQABBDQRSf8zgvxsusE/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT210WVVGUnVXVXhJYzNsaWJVUkZRMnhaT1ZCdGJXYxAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "9 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "我之前去過Yau Veggie Truck在荃灣的餐廳，所以我一直很想來嚐嚐！很高興看到WestK有了這家餐車，素食選擇又多了。我已經來過幾次了，特別喜歡他們家的經典起司漢堡。我通常會點套餐，裡面的炸薯餅熱氣騰騰，超級好吃。餐車就在M+附近，從Elements > M+ > WestK碼頭走過就能找到！",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "I was very keen on trying Yau Veggie Truck as I’ve been to their resto in Tseun Wan! And very happy to see that WestK has more veggie options with this food truck here. I have been here a few times now, and I really like their classic cheese burger. I usually go with a set, and the tater tots are served piping hot and yummy. It’s located close to M+ so you can just walk from Elements > M+ > WestK pier and you’ll find the place!",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Dree Chua",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117323851486329014318/reviews",
          "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUPqBDZMYttVhHHneLzOr-pD5AmsOBbg6hzMZWxz918DrdwmD3k=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6"
        },
        "publishTime": "2026-01-10T14:55:15.433238572Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT210WVVGUnVXVXhJYzNsaWJVUkZRMnhaT1ZCdGJXYxAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT210WVVGUnVXVXhJYzNsaWJVUkZRMnhaT1ZCdGJXYxAB!2m1!1s0x3404010011666ee7:0xc1ba6cfc8233ff49"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJ525mEQABBDQRSf8zgvxsusE/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT201Vk9HcHhha2hJTW5kUFNtYzNZbkUyWjBvMExVRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "7 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "這是我吃過最好吃的素食漢堡之一。傍晚時分的香港海港景色美不勝收，是個非常美好的體驗。謝謝。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "One of the best Veggie Bürgers I ate so  far. The surrondings at Hong Kong harbour is magic in the early evening, so a very nice experience. Thanks.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Ulrich Kamp",
